    <div class="card border-secondary">
        <div class="card-header fw-semibold">Interpretation and current limitations</div>
        <div class="card-body">
            <ul class="mb-0">
                <li>
                    Actual, good, rejected, runtime and downtime values include only records whose validation status is <strong>validated</strong>.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Target quantity includes approved or active production orders whose planned start falls inside the selected timezone-aware period.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Observed utilization is runtime divided by runtime plus recorded downtime. It is not yet the final scheduled line-utilization KPI because planned available time is not stored explicitly.
                </li>
                <li>
                    All displayed values come from simulated ERP data or controlled DSS entries. They are prototype results, not real company production figures.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
